{%- comment -%}
  A banner that is only an image.

  For artwork whose message is set into it rather than a background with theme
  text over it, which is what the hero does. Nothing is overlaid here.

  Because the words are part of the picture, ib_alt is where they exist for a
  screen reader, for search, and for anyone whose image never arrives. Left
  blank the banner is announced as nothing at all.

  A snippet rather than only a section, because the offer page wants it
  directly below its hero — and the hero, intro and grid are one section, so
  template order cannot put anything between them. sections/image-banner.liquid
  renders this for anywhere a section can go; main-collection renders it for
  that one position.

  Accepts: ib_image, ib_image_sm, ib_alt, ib_link, ib_full_bleed,
           ib_starts_at, ib_ends_at.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign ib_now = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
  assign ib_show = true
  if ib_starts_at != blank
    assign ib_from = ib_starts_at | date: '%s' | plus: 0
    if ib_now < ib_from
      assign ib_show = false
    endif
  endif
  if ib_ends_at != blank
    assign ib_to = ib_ends_at | date: '%s' | plus: 0
    if ib_now >= ib_to
      assign ib_show = false
    endif
  endif
-%}

{%- if ib_image != blank and ib_show -%}
  <section class="section-sm img-banner-sec{% if ib_full_bleed %} is-bleed{% endif %}">
    <div class="{% unless ib_full_bleed %}container{% endunless %}">
      {%- comment -%}
        <picture> with a media query, not srcset and sizes. The phone file is
        a different crop, not a smaller copy of the same one, and srcset picks
        on pixels: a 390px handset at DPR 3 asks for 1170px and is handed the
        full-width desktop strip, so the crop would never be seen on the
        phones it was made for. media asks the question that actually decides
        it, which is how wide the screen is.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- capture ib_tag -%}
        <picture>
          {%- if ib_image_sm != blank -%}
            <source media="(max-width: 760px)" srcset="{{ ib_image_sm | asset_url }}">
          {%- endif -%}
          <img class="img-banner"
               src="{{ ib_image | asset_url }}"
               alt="{{ ib_alt | escape }}"
               loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </picture>
      {%- endcapture -%}
      {%- if ib_link != blank -%}
        <a class="img-banner-link" href="{{ ib_link }}">{{ ib_tag }}</a>
      {%- else -%}
        {{ ib_tag }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </section>
{%- endif -%}
